    "description": "GlobalScholar.com offers a unique online tutoring platform, where parents and students can safely connect with trusted educators who provide one-on-one tutoring, homework help or self-paced learning. The GlobalScholar platform includes a student information system which can be used by schools and school districts to enable teachers and administrators to more efficiently and effectively create, manage, and align content, assessments, class scheduling, curriculum, standards, and supplemental learning to drive educational performance.\n \n•\tLead software developer - Contributed FTB design and implementation for the Student Information System ASP.NET web application product. The SIS application is a 3 tier application and I work within all layers of the application including database, DAL, Business Logic, and Web application.\n•\tPioneered most of the user interface standards and custom controls. Followed industry “best-practices” in all aspects of application design and implementation to ensure performance, security, scalability, maintainability and cross-browser support. Using SQL Server 2008 R2, C#, Team Foundation Server, Microsoft Ajax, telerik RadControls for ASP.NET AJAX, LINQ2SQL, C# Generics, JQuery, Web Services, WCF Services, and PageMethods. \n•\tEstablished a release process, documented and trained support staff and installers, handled all production release remote installations until an installations team could be put in place.\n•\tHandled escalated support issues / corresponded with customers, support staff, trainers, and installers.\n•\tParticipated in team Agile development methods including daily scrum and sprint planning.",
